'''Macaio Station''' ({{Langx|an|Estación de Macau}}) is a major [[W:Train station|railway station]] in the [[Pyahu'akã]] barrio of [[Macaio]], [[Carpinchera]], serving the Baliscan intercity rail network, with the [[Conector Solana|''Conector Solana'']] and [[West Atlántida Railway|''Atlántida Oeste'']] railways, along with the [[Macaio–Uxiu high-speed rail line|Baixas]], [[Macaio–Xàbia high-speed rail line|Pantanal]] and [[Daramazán–Macaio high-speed rail line|Miramar]] [[AVB|high-speed rail]] lines. It is a major public transport hub, with dedicated stations on [[Macaio Metro]] lines [[B Line (Macaio Metro)|B]], [[L Line (Macaio Metro)|L]] and [[S Line (Macaio Metro)|S]], as well as a [[W:Bus station|bus station]].  

